  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb (Expensive)</p>\n<p>Needs a power source and a tripod. Switched on, it scans a 10x10m/yds (5x5 square) area in front of it, pulls from the local crime database, and projects the most likely events there over the last 2 hours. +2 to Deduction and Criminology checks to study or understand that crime scene, or +4 for Enforcers/Lawmen. Toggle the gear on, then tick the bonus in the roll dialog when it applies (add the extra +2 for Lawmen by hand).</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Gear, Drugs, &amp; Frames &gt; General Gear).</em></p>"
